      "content": "been out 8 months now and i still feel like a ghost. like i walk around and i can see everything but nothing can see me back. my kids don't answer, my old job's gone, the house i used to own somebody else is living in it now. mom and dad both passed while i was in. i don't really know how to explain it but i'm not sure there's a version of this world that has me in it anymore",
