    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know. everything i guess. but like... it's not even that it hurts anymore. it's more like, what's the point of trying to get back to something that doesn't exist. my kids grew up without me. my ex has a new husband, they got a whole family going. my parents are gone. everything i was trying to get back to is just... gone. and i'm 41 and starting from zero but like, there's not even a zero. there's less than zero. i'm not sure rebuilding makes sense",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
